abstract: "Automated outside-in check of 220 Dutch webshops (sample from OpenStreetMap) on e-mail security (SPF, DMARC), HTTPS and security headers, legally required information (KvK, VAT number, withdrawal information, accessibility statement) and cookie banners, measured on 15 October 2026. Aggregated results only."
